    "description": "YouFlirt \ud83d\ude18 Flirt and chat with singles near you\r\nChat and flirt with great singles now! YouFlirt provides you with exclusive functions to quickly get in touch with other members.\r\n\r\n\u2705 Detailed profiles: Find singles who share your interests\r\n\u2705 No ads: You won't see any annoying ads on YouFlirt\r\n\u2705 Easy to use\r\n\u2705 Favourites list\r\n\u2705 Make contact directly \ud83d\udc8c\r\n\r\nGhostMode\r\nNormally, other users can see that you have visited their profile. If you don't want it, you can use our premium function \"GhostMode\". This allows you to \"hide\" your visit so that you can view other people's profiles completely anonymously.\r\n\r\nNever miss a flirt\r\nCreate your personal profile on YouFlirt and write what is important to you. In this way you will quickly find like-minded people to chat and flirt with. As soon as you receive a message, you will of course be notified immediately. No matter whether you are shy or like to take the initiative yourself: YouFlirt is an open and friendly community where nobody stays alone for long. Also use our premium functions to flirt as successfully as possible. For example, you can give out virtual gifts, send more messages or share animated GIFs. Does that sound exciting? Then become part of our community today!\r\n\r\nYouFlirt - register now and try it out!",
